# Biome 1, level 17 — The Long Way Round
#
# Spring and hub sit two cells apart on a ring, and the cell between them would connect the two with
# a single conduit for 100 points. The target is 800. The only way to reach it is to leave that cell
# empty and go the other way — nine conduits around the whole ring, worth 817.
#
# This is the length curve as a decision rather than as a table: the short answer is available at
# every moment and it is never the right one. A Pivot Token is granted because the temptation is a
# single placement away and the board has no room to absorb it.

id: biome1-17
name: The Long Way Round

base-score: 100
target-score: 800
